      "value": "<p>Hand-ground lens of Yesodium-clouded glass, set in a Tree-of-Life-shard mount.</p><p><strong>Recall Sephirah (Harmonized, 1/scene).</strong> Look through the lens at any object, person, or location you have previously perceived under a known sephirotic alignment. Recall that alignment now — the GM names which sefirah dominated the moment.</p><p><strong>Memory Edge (Harmonized).</strong> Once per raid, after a magic test resolves, add +1 margin retroactively.</p><p><em>Unharmonized: clear glass. Pretty. Inert.</em></p>",
